<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="&quot;LAMBETH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A borough in South London where Myatt’s Fields Park Greenhouse is located."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lambeth is a London Borough where the Fruit &amp; Veg on Prescription project is implemented in partnership with AT Beacon Project."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lambeth is a London borough associated with the Food Flagship Initiative and related activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lambeth is a borough in London where the Energy Garden project is located, with specific initiatives like the Edible Bus Stop pilot."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lambeth is a borough in London, United Kingdom, noted as a location for Urban Growth's edible garden initiatives."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lambeth is a borough in London, United Kingdom, where FoodCycle's community meals are held."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lambeth is a borough in South London, characterized by high population density, inequality, and the establishment of the Lambeth GP Food Co-op to provide green spaces."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lambeth is the borough in London where Vauxhall City Farm is located, and it is the focus area for the community garden project."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lambeth is the borough in London where the Community Dinners are held, associated with the organization In-Deep."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lambeth is the specific area in London where the Garden Museum is situated, and where the community garden project is based."</data>
