  <data key="d1">"Edible Gardens refer to the initiative and projects undertaken by Urban Growth to create green spaces in urban areas, focusing on health, community, and sustainability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-793ca07a4fd1a42f1e0f5955223694db</data>
