<node id="&quot;COMMUNITY ENGAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Community Engagement describes the broader impact of the food-sharing initiative, including increased church attendance, financial redistribution among community members, and strengthened social bonds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Community Engagement is a key focus area of Urban Growth's edible garden projects, emphasizing collaboration and social networks among residents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Community Engagement is promoted through garden sharing, fostering connections among neighbors and enhancing local cohesion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Community Engagement is the process of involving local residents in FoodCycle's activities, ensuring inclusivity and addressing community needs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Community engagement refers to the process of involving community members in decision-making and initiatives, ensuring that programs are culturally relevant and meet local needs."</data>
