<node id="&quot;FOOD SECURITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Food Security is addressed through the creation of edible gardens, providing local access to fresh produce in deprived areas of London."&lt;SEP&gt;"Food security refers to the availability, access, and utilization of sufficient, nutritious food to meet dietary needs and preferences, ensuring that individuals can live healthy, active lives."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-793ca07a4fd1a42f1e0f5955223694db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4977d07d758202d37b9bcafe187cf775</data>
