<node id="&quot;SARAH BENTLEY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sarah Bentley is the founder of Made In Hackney and delivered a TedX talk on the importance of community kitchens in addressing global food challenges."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sarah Bentley is the founder of Made in Hackney, a plant-based community cookery school, and has a background in journalism and community food growing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3387cc431d1a931e84ad9b68d4709414&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6242bd255129ef617257c6edd758ac2</data>
