<node id="&quot;MADE IN HACKNEY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Made In Hackney is the UK’s first vegan community kitchen and cookery school, established in 2012, and part of the Global Plant Kitchens program. It offers free cooking classes focused on healthy, sustainable, and affordable plant-based meals to address food poverty, social isolation, and promote food justice."&lt;SEP&gt;"Made in Hackney is a charity that collaborates with communities to promote culturally appropriate, celebratory, and health-focused diets, addressing food justice, climate change, and social inequality."&lt;SEP&gt;"Made in Hackney is a community cookery school and food access service organization focused on promoting plant-based diets, facing challenges in fundraising, and aiming to create a global toolkit for similar initiatives."&lt;SEP&gt;"Made in Hackney is a community cookery school and food support service based in Hackney, London. Its mission includes promoting plant-based cuisine, cultural exchange, and community engagement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Made in Hackney is a community organization that provides meals to those in need, operates a cookery school, and faces challenges in securing funding and scaling its impact."&lt;SEP&gt;"Made in Hackney is a cookery school that focuses on promoting plant-based eating through culturally diverse programs, community engagement, and collaboration with healthcare professionals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Made in Hackney is a cooking school that offers classes to help people improve their relationship with food, manage health conditions like type 2 diabetes, and promote plant-based eating through joyful, inclusive experiences."&lt;SEP&gt;"Made in Hackney is a plant-based community cookery school founded in 2012, offering cookery classes, food growing education, and free nutritious meals to vulnerable households, with a focus on food justice, climate action, and health equality."&lt;SEP&gt;"Made in Hackney is an organization that provides food support services, community cookery schools, and emergency meals during crises like the pandemic."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-325caed48e8162a5936d47e38649c77c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6242bd255129ef617257c6edd758ac2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5576f361098cae366991f75721d79df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4977d07d758202d37b9bcafe187cf775&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd61450518bb4c18b3012866d4cdeefa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3387cc431d1a931e84ad9b68d4709414&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c54a23f66d3bd03c066dd017416495&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dfae2dec1d90a27687c11ba43444c54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbdcee9e5e42f35143c82e778ee4d879</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 10}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 72}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 181}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 241}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DR. RUPY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dr. Rupy is a collaborator and supporter of Made in Hackney, contributing to their crowdfunding campaign and advocating for the organization's mission."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dr. Rupy is a colleague or professional who acknowledges the compassionate and collaborative approach of Sarah and her team in addressing food-related challenges."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dr. Rupy is a health professional who collaborates with Made in Hackney, advocating for integrating cooking classes into healthcare to empower patients with dietary knowledge."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dr. Rupy is a medical doctor, nutrition researcher, and host of the Doctor's Kitchen podcast, who has been an ambassador for Made in Hackney since 2016."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dr. Rupy is a participant in the conversation, emphasizing the importance of food as a security blanket for people in crisis and supporting community initiatives like Made in Hackney."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dr. Rupy is an interviewer discussing Sarah's journey and the origins of Made in Hackney, highlighting the alignment of her purpose with the organization's mission."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dr. Rupy is an interviewer who discusses Sarah's work with Made in Hackney and her journey into veganism and community kitchens."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-325caed48e8162a5936d47e38649c77c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5576f361098cae366991f75721d79df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4977d07d758202d37b9bcafe187cf775&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3387cc431d1a931e84ad9b68d4709414&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c54a23f66d3bd03c066dd017416495&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dfae2dec1d90a27687c11ba43444c54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbdcee9e5e42f35143c82e778ee4d879</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 10}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 72}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 184}]</data>
</node>
