<node id="&quot;PANDEMIC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Pandemic refers to the global health crisis that led to the launch of emergency food support services by Made in Hackney."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pandemic refers to the global health crisis that prompted Made in Hackney to initiate its free nutritious meal service for vulnerable households."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Pandemic is referenced as a significant event that impacted Dr. Rupy's work, leading to a shift in focus and full-time commitment to his role."&lt;SEP&gt;"The pandemic is the central event that shaped the role of community gardens in London, highlighting their importance in providing food, green space, and social connection."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dd61450518bb4c18b3012866d4cdeefa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3387cc431d1a931e84ad9b68d4709414&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77d3ebf47681d85637b367b018867d2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5576f361098cae366991f75721d79df</data>
