<node id="&quot;SARAH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sarah is a food activist and environmental activist who co-founded Made in Hackney, a cookery school that promotes plant-based eating through culturally relevant programs and community collaboration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sarah is a journalist and founder of Made in Hackney, dedicated to food justice, empowerment, and community-driven initiatives. She transitioned from writing to hands-on work in food and environmental issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sarah is a key figure in running Made in Hackney, discussing the challenges of funding, community support, and the impact of food solidarity on individuals and families."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sarah is a key figure in the organization Made in Hackney, actively involved in fundraising, community outreach, and advocating for the creation of a global toolkit to support similar initiatives."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sarah is a professional involved in food support services, advocating for universal basic income and the importance of providing nutritious meals to those in need."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sarah is the founder and leader of Made in Hackney, emphasizing the importance of joy, inclusivity, and practical food education in health improvement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sarah is the founder of Made in Hackney, a community cookery school that later expanded into food support services. She has a background in reggae music journalism and transitioned into promoting plant-based cuisine and social justice through food."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-325caed48e8162a5936d47e38649c77c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5576f361098cae366991f75721d79df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4977d07d758202d37b9bcafe187cf775&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd61450518bb4c18b3012866d4cdeefa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6c54a23f66d3bd03c066dd017416495&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dfae2dec1d90a27687c11ba43444c54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbdcee9e5e42f35143c82e778ee4d879</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 10}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 72}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 182}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 245}]</data>
</node>
