<node id="&quot;VANDANA SHIVA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Vandana Shiva is a person quoted in the text, emphasizing the importance of seed control and the role of seeds in cultural and social identity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vandana Shiva is an Indian activist and environmentalist whose conversation with Sarah influenced her life's purpose and work in food justice."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vandana Shiva is an activist and advocate for seed sovereignty, whose global call to protect seed heritage inspired the creation of the London Freedom Seed Bank."</data>
