  <data key="d1">"An organization associated with the URL https://londonfreedomseedbank.wordpress.com/category/raising-awareness, focused on raising awareness about seed preservation."&lt;SEP&gt;"An organization that promotes seed saving and sharing, bringing a portable seed bank to events and educating the public about seed diversity."&lt;SEP&gt;"London Freedom Seed Bank is a community-led organization in London dedicated to saving, storing, and sharing open-pollinated seeds. It organizes seed distribution, seed swap events, and collaborates with other seed preservation initiatives."&lt;SEP&gt;"London Freedom Seed Bank is an organization based in London, dedicated to saving, storing, and sharing open-pollinated seeds within the community."&lt;SEP&gt;"The London Freedom Seed Bank is a London-wide network of seed savers, community gardeners, and food justice activists dedicated to saving, storing, and distributing open-pollinated seed varieties. It was created in 2012 by Azul Thomé and others in response to Vandana Shiva’s call to protect seed heritage. It is volunteer-run and focuses on seed sovereignty, education, and collaboration."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5ada7ecea801f637810ca85f973d5cb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af4130ead67b8862fd5cd6ef12ca876b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9925a5652d4492c5d873f2b24b55150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7debcc7a12d29ff24c547a648de0517&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60dc7f1ab4bc9b4e9ad9725f17729192</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 59}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 169}]</data>
</node>
