  <data key="d6">chunk-4977d07d758202d37b9bcafe187cf775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKING POVERTY&quot;" target="&quot;COST OF LIVING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Working poverty is directly influenced by the rising cost of living, which outpaces wages and benefits, forcing individuals into difficult financial choices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4977d07d758202d37b9bcafe187cf775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKING POVERTY&quot;" target="&quot;TEMPORARY ACCOMMODATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Temporary accommodation is often associated with working poverty, as individuals in unstable housing may lack the resources to prepare nutritious meals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4977d07d758202d37b9bcafe187cf775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKING POVERTY&quot;" target="&quot;ECONOMIC DISPARITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Economic disparities are closely linked to working poverty, as low wages and stagnant benefits exacerbate financial instability for vulnerable populations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4977d07d758202d37b9bcafe187cf775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKING POVERTY&quot;" target="&quot;SOCIAL WELFARE SYSTEMS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Social welfare systems play a role in addressing working poverty by providing financial support, though benefit levels often fall short of meeting basic needs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4977d07d758202d37b9bcafe187cf775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKING POVERTY&quot;" target="&quot;CAPITALISM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Capitalism is critiqued in the text for contributing to working poverty through systemic wage disparities and the undervaluation of essential labor."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4977d07d758202d37b9bcafe187cf775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKING POVERTY&quot;" target="&quot;SYSTEMIC INEQUALITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Systemic inequality is a root cause of working poverty, as it perpetuates wage gaps and limits access to fair employment and living wages."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4977d07d758202d37b9bcafe187cf775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKING POVERTY&quot;" target="&quot;ECONOMIC EMPOWERMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Economic empowerment is a key goal in addressing working poverty, as it seeks to equip individuals with the tools to improve their financial stability and quality of life."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4977d07d758202d37b9bcafe187cf775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKING POVERTY&quot;" target="&quot;FOOD ACCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Food access is a significant challenge for individuals in working poverty, as they often struggle to afford healthy food despite being employed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4977d07d758202d37b9bcafe187cf775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WORKING POVERTY&quot;" target="&quot;FOOD INSECURITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Food insecurity is a significant challenge for individuals in working poverty, as they often struggle to afford nutritious food despite being employed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4977d07d758202d37b9bcafe187cf775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BENEFIT LEVEL&quot;" target="&quot;COST OF LIVING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The cost of living has increased significantly while benefit levels have stagnated, creating a widening gap between income and essential expenses."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4977d07d758202d37b9bcafe187cf775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BENEFIT LEVEL&quot;" target="&quot;SOCIAL WELFARE SYSTEMS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Social welfare systems determine benefit levels, which are often insufficient to meet the rising cost of living and contribute to economic disparities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4977d07d758202d37b9bcafe187cf775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COST OF LIVING&quot;" target="&quot;TEMPORARY ACCOMMODATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Temporary accommodation reflects the challenges of high cost of living, where individuals may prioritize immediate needs over long-term stability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4977d07d758202d37b9bcafe187cf775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COST OF LIVING&quot;" target="&quot;ECONOMIC DISPARITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Economic disparities are amplified by the rising cost of living, which disproportionately affects low-income individuals and families."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4977d07d758202d37b9bcafe187cf775</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
